WEBVTT

00:03.200 --> 00:06.917
We will now begin the 57th
expedition beyond the walls!

00:07.900 --> 00:10.125
Onward!

00:14.290 --> 00:17.990
We believe that in the basement of
Eren Jaeger's Zhiganshina home,

00:17.990 --> 00:20.057
there are answers about the Titans
that he himself doesn't have.

00:22.120 --> 00:23.838
We will head there.

00:24.830 --> 00:26.964
You new recruits will be here.

00:27.020 --> 00:28.650
You'll be between the cart guard team

00:28.650 --> 00:30.554
and the recon support team.

00:30.950 --> 00:34.347
Your job will be to ride alongside the
spare horses and relay messages.

00:34.550 --> 00:37.560
The Special Operations
Squad will be here.

00:37.560 --> 00:39.195
Standing by in the center
of the last ranks.

00:39.760 --> 00:43.324
It's the safest place in the formation.

00:43.349 --> 00:45.860
Special ops will be here.

00:57.740 --> 00:58.780
That's no Aberrant.

00:59.390 --> 01:00.870
It's intelligent!

01:01.450 --> 01:04.290
Like the Armored or Colossal
Titans, or Eren...

01:04.800 --> 01:06.960
A human in the body of a Titan!

01:10.150 --> 01:12.550
Its movements are much more
precise than the others' are!

01:12.970 --> 01:13.820
Damn it.

01:13.820 --> 01:14.860
I...

01:14.860 --> 01:16.380
I underestimated it!

01:18.730 --> 01:20.260
It protected its neck...

01:20.530 --> 01:22.510
Damn it! I can't get away!

01:22.510 --> 01:23.500
Jean!

01:23.500 --> 01:26.250
Avenge the bastard who
rushed to his death!

01:27.950 --> 01:29.400
It stopped?

01:29.960 --> 01:30.990
That's the one...

01:30.990 --> 01:32.740
That's the one that killed him!

01:32.740 --> 01:35.560
He rushed to his death
on the right flank!

01:35.560 --> 01:37.960
Avenge him!

01:52.820 --> 01:55.290
We've bought enough time, right?

01:55.290 --> 01:57.090
Let's get the hell away from it!

01:58.760 --> 02:00.730
No... Why?

02:01.310 --> 02:02.360
Is it

02:03.679 --> 02:05.319
heading toward Eren?

02:07.730 --> 02:09.090
Oh, my friend!

02:09.090 --> 02:11.610
This is a victory for us!

02:11.670 --> 02:14.770
Our fame starts here!

02:14.810 --> 02:15.870
Oh, my friend!

02:15.870 --> 02:21.070
Let us celebrate this victory for the next battle!

02:35.710 --> 02:41.250
"I died for naught"
I won't let it end like that for you

02:41.250 --> 02:46.510
until I am the last one standing

02:46.510 --> 02:49.490
The enemy is cruel... We will kill...

02:49.490 --> 02:52.530
The enemy is colossal... We will jump...

02:52.530 --> 02:56.170
In our hands we hold blades of glory

02:56.170 --> 02:58.450
and sing in the name of victory

02:58.450 --> 03:03.090
We bear the wings of freedom on our backs

03:04.410 --> 03:10.530
Swearing iron determination upon our hearts,

03:10.550 --> 03:15.070
we slash apart the circle of idiocy

03:16.650 --> 03:18.970
and soar through the sky

03:19.030 --> 03:23.230
with our wings of freedom

03:36.980 --> 03:41.990
Forest of Giant Trees: The 57th Exterior Scouting Mission, Part 2

03:49.370 --> 03:52.210
How's your 3D Maneuver Gear looking, Armin?

03:52.970 --> 03:54.170
It's okay...

03:54.170 --> 03:57.710
The clasp released as intended,
so it seems it's not broken.

03:58.380 --> 03:59.380
I see...

03:59.380 --> 04:00.630
I'm glad to hear it.

04:01.090 --> 04:02.880
But what do we do?

04:02.880 --> 04:04.720
We only have one horse.

04:05.970 --> 04:09.390
If Jean's horse comes back,
the three of us can move, but...

04:10.480 --> 04:12.270
Damn it, why?

04:12.840 --> 04:17.780
Reiner's horse returned, so why didn't mine?

04:21.400 --> 04:25.290
We can't stay here any longer.

04:27.450 --> 04:30.620
In the worst case, we'll have
to leave someone here...

04:31.160 --> 04:34.210
But how would we decide who to leave?

04:35.000 --> 04:36.420
Armin, since he's wounded?

04:37.420 --> 04:40.250
Reiner, since he's big and would have
trouble riding with someone else?

04:41.300 --> 04:44.680
Or should I run and try to find my horse?

04:47.090 --> 04:48.260
Damn it!

04:48.260 --> 04:51.220
Why the hell do I have to think about this?!

04:51.680 --> 04:54.220
We all made it through that fight alive.

04:54.220 --> 04:56.560
This isn't fair...

05:13.580 --> 05:14.410
Armin...

05:16.210 --> 05:17.040
Hey, Armin!

05:19.000 --> 05:21.360
Are you still out of it?

05:21.950 --> 05:25.130
Yeah, my head's still a bit fuzzy...

05:25.510 --> 05:26.510
I see...

05:26.800 --> 05:28.970
But we must decide.

05:29.470 --> 05:33.350
It's a hard choice, but someone
will have to stay behind.

05:36.450 --> 05:37.440
Wait!

05:38.280 --> 05:40.860
First, let's fire a smoke round...

05:40.860 --> 05:42.900
If the formation continued straight ahead,

05:42.900 --> 05:45.650
the row 4-3 team should be nearby.

05:51.450 --> 05:53.950
That's the signal for an emergency...

05:53.950 --> 05:57.190
But I can't imagine they'll understand
our intentions just from that.

05:57.670 --> 05:59.830
Armin, we can wait another three minutes.

06:00.440 --> 06:02.750
By then, we must decide—

06:02.750 --> 06:03.750
I'll stay.

06:05.050 --> 06:09.550
But there's something I want
you to tell them for me...

06:10.220 --> 06:12.180
Preferably to Commander Erwin alone—

06:12.180 --> 06:13.470
No, Armin.

06:13.930 --> 06:16.100
You should tell him yourself.

06:16.810 --> 06:18.310
Looks like someone's here...

06:18.770 --> 06:21.230
And with two horses!

06:23.860 --> 06:25.150
That's...

06:27.650 --> 06:28.820
Krista!

06:29.450 --> 06:31.660
Is everyone okay?

06:35.450 --> 06:37.290
That's my horse...

06:37.910 --> 06:38.790
Whoa, whoa.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.470
Calm down, Buchwald.

06:41.010 --> 06:44.410
He ran toward me, terrified...

06:45.340 --> 06:46.590
Did you engage the Titans?

06:47.550 --> 06:50.380
Armin, what happened to you?

06:50.380 --> 06:51.510
Are you okay?

06:51.510 --> 06:52.850
Yeah, I think so.

06:54.630 --> 06:57.430
I can't believe that smoke
round brought you here.

06:58.020 --> 07:01.350
I was nearby, and I already had Jean's horse.

07:01.690 --> 07:03.860
Even horses like you.

07:03.860 --> 07:05.860
It seems you have a strange charisma.

07:06.210 --> 07:07.360
You saved our lives.

07:08.650 --> 07:10.150
But I'm so glad

07:11.200 --> 07:14.160
that the worst didn't happen to you.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.450
I really am glad.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.170
God...

07:23.170 --> 07:24.400
A goddess.

07:25.500 --> 07:26.690
I want to marry her.

07:27.810 --> 07:30.510
Well, we should rejoin the
formation as soon as possible.

07:30.510 --> 07:33.470
Yeah, there should be orders to retreat.

07:36.470 --> 07:40.680
To think we've been pushed back,
less than an hour out of the walls.

07:40.680 --> 07:43.150
Things are even bleaker
than I'd imagined...

07:43.380 --> 07:44.640
And for some reason,

07:44.640 --> 07:48.110
it went in the opposite direction from
the vanguard command team...

07:48.110 --> 07:49.070
It?

07:52.110 --> 07:53.600
A green round?

07:54.140 --> 07:56.280
Looks like they're continuing the operation,

07:56.280 --> 07:57.990
only changing course...

07:58.620 --> 07:59.520
What?

07:59.520 --> 08:01.330
That wasn't a retreat command?

08:01.330 --> 08:03.920
What is Commander Erwin thinking?

08:04.250 --> 08:07.750
In theory, any soldier has
the authority to determine

08:07.750 --> 08:09.720
when mission completion
is no longer possible.

08:10.270 --> 08:13.380
Did command not see our
smoke round somehow?

08:13.380 --> 08:14.620
Even if we don't know what's going on,

08:14.620 --> 08:17.010
there's still only one thing for us to do...

08:17.470 --> 08:18.910
Follow the order!

08:26.310 --> 08:27.400
Smoke round.

08:27.770 --> 08:28.900
Green.

08:29.270 --> 08:31.150
Oluo, you fire it.

08:31.530 --> 08:32.570
Roger.

08:33.350 --> 08:36.030
For now, everything seems to be going fine.

08:37.640 --> 08:40.630
But is it really?

08:41.200 --> 08:44.250
We may already have casualties
on the front lines.

08:44.250 --> 08:45.290
Reporting!

08:46.080 --> 08:47.290
Message to pass along!

08:47.580 --> 08:49.630
Right flank recon has been destroyed!

08:50.200 --> 08:52.170
Our recon system is partially inoperative.

08:52.170 --> 08:54.550
Pass this on, to the left.

08:55.760 --> 08:57.300
Did you hear that, Petra?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.600
Go.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.560
Yes, Captain.

09:01.270 --> 09:02.560
The right flank?!

09:03.270 --> 09:05.350
I think that's where Armin is.

09:05.980 --> 09:11.170
But Armin and the others should still
be in position, near the center.

09:11.170 --> 09:13.520
The Titans can't have made it in that far...

09:15.470 --> 09:16.860
A black round?

09:17.170 --> 09:18.700
Aberrants?

09:18.870 --> 09:20.990
Eren, you fire it.

09:20.990 --> 09:22.320
R-Right!

09:22.640 --> 09:24.410
What a mess.

09:24.940 --> 09:28.330
We let it penetrate deep into our formation.

09:30.210 --> 09:31.800
It's almost here...

09:31.800 --> 09:33.170
The Titan.

09:33.570 --> 09:38.260
Beneath those smoke rounds,
is there someone fighting?

09:50.820 --> 09:51.770
Damn it...

09:52.150 --> 09:53.570
Look over here.

09:54.610 --> 09:56.860
You monster...

10:00.660 --> 10:01.580
Now!

10:10.130 --> 10:11.810
Three separate attacks at once...

10:11.810 --> 10:15.590
You're pretty smart, but you can't
possibly protect all three targets!

10:16.130 --> 10:17.550
Spine, Achilles tendon...

10:17.550 --> 10:18.880
It doesn't matter!

10:18.880 --> 10:20.970
Hit one, and we will slow it down...

10:21.350 --> 10:22.640
Go!

10:24.430 --> 10:26.060
Damn you for causing so many deaths!

10:26.310 --> 10:28.060
We'll make you die a slow, painful death!

10:34.500 --> 10:35.610
It jumped?

10:49.540 --> 10:51.580
L-Let me go!

11:20.860 --> 11:24.200
The most important thing is
to ensure they hear of this...

11:24.590 --> 11:26.580
I must tell them what we're up against!

11:33.880 --> 11:35.090
An Aberrant?!

11:35.420 --> 11:36.840
It got in all the way here?

11:37.170 --> 11:38.290
We'll take it out!

11:38.290 --> 11:40.670
We can't let it penetrate any farther!

11:57.100 --> 11:59.740
The right flank's been wiped out?

11:59.740 --> 12:01.350
But we aren't withdrawing?

12:01.380 --> 12:02.240
Why?!

12:02.240 --> 12:03.490
No idea...

12:03.490 --> 12:04.950
The Commander's orders...

12:04.950 --> 12:06.780
Just relay the message to the left!

12:15.790 --> 12:17.090
What's going on?

12:17.710 --> 12:20.210
We keep heading east.

12:21.220 --> 12:24.090
Our goal is supposed to
be south, to the old city.

12:24.600 --> 12:26.409
Right now, our formation's

12:26.434 --> 12:28.010
on a collision course.

12:28.010 --> 12:28.850
Yeah.

12:29.350 --> 12:30.680
You can see it...

12:31.430 --> 12:33.069
The forest of giant trees!

12:49.690 --> 12:51.940
Seems Titans passed through here.

12:54.400 --> 12:56.530
There's nothing growing on the road.

13:00.820 --> 13:02.580
We can bring the carts through, too.

13:04.120 --> 13:05.650
Send word to the rear

13:06.270 --> 13:10.000
that only the central cart guard
should enter the forest.

13:10.000 --> 13:10.960
Yes, sir!

13:25.600 --> 13:27.380
Excuse me, sir...

13:27.380 --> 13:30.840
The center row appears to
be entering the forest,

13:30.840 --> 13:33.960
but wouldn't the rest of
us collide with the forest?

13:35.570 --> 13:36.650
We're going around.

13:37.770 --> 13:38.470
Yes, sir!

13:41.990 --> 13:45.830
Hey, what are we doing at this tourist spot?

13:46.200 --> 13:50.540
We're totally off from both our original
destination and our return point.

13:51.170 --> 13:52.330
I don't know...

13:53.170 --> 13:56.260
I don't know, but the order came from
Commander Erwin, after all.

13:56.590 --> 13:58.970
He must have a plan.

13:59.430 --> 14:01.300
What kind of plan?

14:01.890 --> 14:03.850
Are they planning to hold a welcome ceremony

14:03.850 --> 14:06.130
for us new recruits at a tourist spot?

14:06.130 --> 14:08.680
No, I don't think so.

14:08.680 --> 14:09.810
That was a joke.

14:10.560 --> 14:13.900
Anyway, that giant woman's following us.

14:14.400 --> 14:18.570
No matter what his plan, we can't stay here.

14:19.420 --> 14:20.740
The only thing I can imagine

14:20.740 --> 14:23.700
is that we're passing through
on our way to somewhere else...

14:24.120 --> 14:25.700
Everyone, halt!

14:29.290 --> 14:31.920
All right. Listen up, recruits.

14:32.410 --> 14:34.920
We will now make preparations
to launch a counterattack.

14:34.920 --> 14:36.920
Draw your blades, and wait above in the trees.

14:37.280 --> 14:40.920
If any Titans try to enter this forest,
stop them at all costs!

14:41.220 --> 14:44.490
U-Um, Sir, what do you—

14:44.490 --> 14:46.100
Shut up and follow orders!

14:50.680 --> 14:52.170
Seriously?

14:52.170 --> 14:53.770
What's going on?

14:58.030 --> 15:02.950
H-Hey, it looks like only the center
line went into the woods.

15:02.950 --> 15:04.460
What happened to the formation?

15:05.030 --> 15:06.620
It's gone.

15:07.280 --> 15:10.070
The forest blocks our advance,
so the left and right flanks

15:10.070 --> 15:12.210
will have to skirt the forest.

15:12.660 --> 15:14.710
We've lost our recon ability.

15:15.830 --> 15:18.710
Why didn't we change course
to avoid this forest?

15:19.170 --> 15:21.880
Did Commander Erwin read the map wrong?

15:22.550 --> 15:23.750
I don't know...

15:24.170 --> 15:27.010
Perhaps we tried too hard to avoid the threat

15:27.010 --> 15:30.590
on the right flank and ended up here...

15:39.190 --> 15:41.150
This is insane...

15:42.400 --> 15:45.660
We've abandoned the original
mission to cache supplies.

15:46.490 --> 15:49.700
And when we abandoned it,
we should've turned tail and run...

15:50.240 --> 15:52.910
But instead, we're forging
ahead to a tourist trap.

15:53.910 --> 15:56.290
And now, we're just standing here,

15:56.710 --> 15:59.130
to stop any Titans that enter the woods?

16:02.590 --> 16:06.470
Damn him for giving a crazy order.

16:06.840 --> 16:08.260
He'll hear you...

16:08.260 --> 16:12.100
And this no real explanation
thing is innovative, too.

16:12.100 --> 16:16.150
Of course, I'm sure he has his own concerns...

16:16.480 --> 16:17.480
What do you mean?

16:17.810 --> 16:22.420
A commander deemed worthless
by his men in a critical situation

16:22.420 --> 16:26.360
quite often succumbs to a
mysterious attack from behind.

16:26.660 --> 16:29.490
I'm just saying it wouldn't surprise me.

16:30.450 --> 16:32.750
Jean, so what are you going to do?

16:33.750 --> 16:35.370
Don't be so serious...

16:35.960 --> 16:38.500
This situation's got me a
bit worked up, that's all.

16:39.210 --> 16:41.100
What am I going to do?

16:41.800 --> 16:45.800
Obey my orders, and keep
Titans out of the forest.

16:47.430 --> 16:50.800
You also think it's the right move, don't you?

16:51.010 --> 16:51.760
Ah—

16:52.570 --> 16:54.560
You look like you know something.

16:55.180 --> 16:56.560
Well...

16:57.910 --> 16:59.680
Five-meter class incoming!

17:06.440 --> 17:09.710
Why bring the formation here?

17:10.410 --> 17:13.790
What is Commander Erwin thinking?

17:14.540 --> 17:18.290
No, that isn't what
we should think about.

17:18.920 --> 17:21.380
The Female Titan is pursuing Eren.

17:21.840 --> 17:24.300
And the Commander knows that.

17:24.800 --> 17:28.300
Assume those two things,
and see what you can deduce...

17:29.680 --> 17:30.590
Captain...

17:30.970 --> 17:32.220
Captain Levi!

17:32.810 --> 17:33.760
What?

17:34.350 --> 17:35.520
Well...

17:35.520 --> 17:37.080
We're in the middle of the woods!

17:37.730 --> 17:40.310
If the center enters alone,

17:40.310 --> 17:42.360
we won't know if Titans are approaching!

17:42.820 --> 17:44.900
It seems something's approaching '
us from the right...

17:45.440 --> 17:49.200
How are we supposed to dodge
the Titans or protect the carts?

17:49.530 --> 17:52.120
Don't go on and on about the obvious...

17:52.670 --> 17:54.790
We can't do that anymore, of course.

17:55.660 --> 17:57.450
Th-Then why?

17:57.790 --> 17:59.620
Look around, Eren...

18:00.040 --> 18:02.210
At all these big-ass trees.

18:04.630 --> 18:08.420
It's the perfect environment
for 3D Maneuver Gear.

18:09.430 --> 18:13.870
And try to use that tiny brain of yours...

18:14.330 --> 18:17.060
If you don't want to die, think.

18:17.560 --> 18:18.680
Yes, sir!

18:19.810 --> 18:20.980
I see.

18:21.500 --> 18:24.790
I just can't keep up right now
because I'm still new.

18:25.440 --> 18:27.850
He won't just tell me the answer.

18:27.850 --> 18:30.230
I have to figure it out for myself.

18:30.990 --> 18:34.660
I'm sure that's how they all learned to fight.

18:36.700 --> 18:38.180
What the hell?

18:38.180 --> 18:39.750
Seriously?

18:39.750 --> 18:43.750
Damn it all... What the hell is going on here?

18:46.550 --> 18:47.630
Wait!

18:48.300 --> 18:53.400
Wait a minute... No one knows
what's really going on?

18:54.510 --> 18:58.340
Maybe not even Captain Levi?

19:00.180 --> 19:02.310
The Female Titan is after Eren...

19:02.940 --> 19:04.940
If I'm right about that,

19:04.940 --> 19:07.150
then there's only one reason to come here.

19:08.320 --> 19:11.990
This is where Commander Erwin intends
to deal with the Female Titan...

19:11.990 --> 19:13.030
Armin...

19:14.140 --> 19:19.080
Our orders were to keep the
Titans out of the forest, right?

19:21.340 --> 19:22.290
In other words...

19:23.000 --> 19:26.090
There's no longer any reason to fight...

19:27.160 --> 19:28.380
Right?

20:02.500 --> 20:03.710
A black smoke round?

20:03.710 --> 20:05.330
It's from directly behind us!

20:05.590 --> 20:08.010
It's whatever was coming
toward us on the right.

20:08.670 --> 20:10.170
Draw your blades.

20:13.630 --> 20:17.930
If we see it, it'll only be for a second.

20:42.120 --> 20:43.030
Go!

20:57.950 --> 20:59.010
It's fast!

20:59.010 --> 21:02.010
In these trees, there's no way to
foresee and evade its attacks!

21:02.010 --> 21:03.060
It'll catch us!

21:03.270 --> 21:05.230
Captain, let's switch to Maneuver Gear!

21:05.890 --> 21:06.890
Captain!

21:09.310 --> 21:10.730
You won't escape!

21:11.320 --> 21:12.730
Reinforcements from the rear!

21:28.580 --> 21:30.630
Captain, your orders?!

21:30.830 --> 21:31.880
Let's go for it!

21:31.880 --> 21:33.130
It's dangerous...

21:33.630 --> 21:35.550
We should kill it!

21:36.840 --> 21:38.680
I'll rip you apart!

21:40.760 --> 21:43.850
Fool, you've run straight into hell.

21:44.240 --> 21:48.010
You're chasing a group of master
Titan killers!

21:50.790 --> 21:52.080
Captain Levi?

21:53.050 --> 21:54.230
Captain!

21:54.510 --> 21:55.840
Give us your orders.

21:55.840 --> 21:58.050
At this rate, it will catch up with us!

21:58.050 --> 21:59.500
We kill it here...

21:59.500 --> 22:01.440
That's why we came to this forest!

22:01.440 --> 22:03.370
Right, Captain?

22:03.370 --> 22:05.410
Captain, your orders!

22:08.650 --> 22:10.870
Everyone, cover your ears.

22:36.200 --> 22:41.590
If we suppose that I am not me,

22:41.590 --> 22:46.130
Can you say with certainty that you are you?

22:46.780 --> 22:51.660
Will you be able to pick up after yourself

22:51.660 --> 22:56.810
Once your sand-like shell breaks and your heart crumbles?

22:57.090 --> 23:02.020
I could hear someone calling

23:02.310 --> 23:05.920
But now my ears are just ringing

23:06.240 --> 23:11.080
It's as if time has frozen

23:11.380 --> 23:13.990
Now, wake up

23:13.990 --> 23:18.960
I began to walk through a deep dark abyss

23:19.510 --> 23:24.260
As swift as a gale, I escaped for my life

23:24.670 --> 23:28.830
I felt like a living corpse

23:29.240 --> 23:33.960
We break out of our walls

23:34.270 --> 23:40.350
To reunite in worlds we've yet to map

23:53.555 --> 23:57.207
The Female Titan approaches, continuing its unstoppable massacre.

23:57.916 --> 24:02.133
With no choice but to flee, even as his comrades fall right before his eyes,

24:03.044 --> 24:05.644
Eren is forced to make a decision.

